    "text": "About Us - www.ctasia.com\nHome\nAbout Us\nSolutions\nChat Mgt.\nIncident Mgt.\nOutbound Mgt.\nInbound Mgt.\nOmni Channel\nAwards\nOur Customers\nContact Us\nMenu\nHome\nAbout Us\nSolutions\nChat Mgt.\nIncident Mgt.\nOutbound Mgt.\nInbound Mgt.\nOmni Channel\nAwards\nOur Customers\nContact Us\nWho We Are\nWe are the leader in the customer service solutions for enterprise. We are Thais. We provide innovative software solutions for contact center, incident management and Tele-sales campaign management. All of these solutions allow your agent interact with your customer via Phone call, E-mail, SMS, Sticker chat.\nIn 2009, we introduced CT Asia Robotics, the visionary company who commits to develop service robot in the area of restaurant, marketing event and health care service.\nIn 2015, “Dinsow” the elderly care robot, starts taking care of the elderly in Thailand and in Japan.\nOur Service Robot\nIn 2009, we built the first service robot of Thailand as well as the first of ASEAN regoin, named Dinsaw. With the vision that in the near future robots will help the human like us especially in the areas that have shortage of human resources such as health care services.\nIn 2010, we built 10 restaurant service robots for MK, the large restaurant chain in Thailand. In 2014, we built 14 robots for the Robot Restaurant in Lidköping, Sweden in order to take order from the customer and also deliver the food to the table.\nAfter years of partnering with hospitals in Thailand and in Japan, we launched Dinsaw, robot for elderly care service. Dinsaws will deliver full service since 2015 in many countries including Japan and EU\nHome\nAbout  Us\nOur Customers\nSolutions\nContact Us\nRobot & AI Solutions\nCOMPUTER TELEPHONY ASIA CO., LTD.\n1635-1637 Pattanakarn Rd., Suan Luang, Suan Luang, Bangkok THAILAND. 10250\nTel :\n+66 2013 1431-4\nFax :\n+66 2013 1436\nCT Asia\nis a leading best-in-class,innovative Contact Center based in Asia.We also provide seamless integrated multifunctional solution, front-end systems ..\nCopyright © 2021 COMPUTER TELEPHONY ASIA CO., LTD. All rights reserved."
